    {
      "id": "about",
      "type": "layout.comment",
      "name": "Original calibration fixtures \u2014 MIT",
      "description": "Original 16-bit RGB simulation, projects and generator under the repository's MIT license. Three bright/dark captures build mean or median references. The median project has an outlier in the third bright capture. A separate held-out image has 1/2 reflectance outside and 1/4 inside its rectangle. Correction to a 1/2 full-scale target produces 16384 and 8192 counts, matching independent pixels exactly. This verifies arithmetic and metadata contracts; physical camera settings require separate qualification.",
